    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d657">

                <pb facs="0631" n="465" sameAs="frus:frus1917/pg465"/>

                <head>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">The Secretary of State to Minister Swenson </hi>
                </head>
                <opener>
                    <seg rendition="#center">[Telegram]</seg>
                </opener>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">
                        <placeName>
                            <hi rendition="#small-caps">Department of State</hi>, <lb/>
                            <hi rendition="#italic">Washington</hi></placeName>, <date
                            calendar="gregorian" when="1900-02-03">
                            <hi rendition="#italic">February 3, 1900</hi></date>.</dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>An important instruction was mailed to you 30th ultimo proposing purchase of
                    Danish West Indies. I have conferred with Danish Minister here, who has advised
                    his Government. You will be prepared to act on receipt of mailed instructions,
                    being careful to impress upon Minister for Foreign Affairs the urgency of
                    adhering to terms of my proposal, inasmuch as it is extremely unlikely that the
                    Senate would assent to any modification. Time is most important.</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>
                        <hi rendition="#small-caps">Hay</hi>
                    </signed>
                </closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
